7	// the Responses API with `response_format: { type: "json_schema" }` (or
8	// `zodResponseFormat`) so the model's output is constrained to the same
9	// return shape, not parsed out of free text.
10	//
11	// Model choice matters for the $70/person OpenAI budget: the deterministic
12	// scoring in src/lib/deriveRequirements.ts already does the expensive part
13	// (frequency/evidence/sales_relevance) with zero LLM calls, by using BMW's
14	// own VFC taxonomy as pre-clustering instead of asking a model to cluster
15	// 14k raw verbatims. That means real LLM calls here are only ever
16	// per-signal or per-requirement (tens to low hundreds), not per-verbatim
17	// (thousands) — so budget is not the constraint, quality is:
18	//   - gpt-4.1-mini: fine for summarizeStakeholderReviews() and the
